      "requirement": "Exercise object-field string validation with a mismatched JSON type and retain its key-aware wrong-type diagnostic.",
      "target_route": "A valid object parses through `json_loadb`; `json_unpack` delegates to `json_vunpack_ex`, which enters `unpack_object` and passes the field key to `unpack`.",
      "failure_condition": "For finite input containing an object such as {\"data\":1}, the target selects only `o` for object values and passes no error output. The supported string mismatch diagnostic cannot be reached or observed.",
      "alternative_paths": "Deep copy, dump, reload and object iteration do not select an unpack value format. The array call also uses `o`; none supplies a typed object-field format or an error output.",
      "discovery_necessary": true,
      "discovery_established": true
    }
  ],
